Structure of docs/agent-notes.md and docs/agent-notes/, over the live tree. The rules are
stated in test/support/agent_notes_scan.ml; the counts scanned go to stderr, since a tally in
a golden moves on every correct addition anywhere (gh-ocannl-665).

every bullet is whole and every list parses as one reading: true
every index row names a file that carries what it claims: true
every table is a table, row by row: true
every notes file is reachable from the index, and links back: true
no bullet is repeated across the notes: true
no source-level GitHub citation uses a bare hash or hashless work label: true
every note anchor AGENTS.md or a tools script points at is a heading its note has: true
every rule the scan names is reported over the live tree: true
every finding carries one of the rules the scan names: true
each flagged bullet has an exemption key of its own: true
every exemption still names a bullet that needs one: true

